0131.gif" alt="icon of scanned page 509" title="scanned icon of page 509" border="1" width="100" class="icon-reflink"></a><div class="figure-role"><a class="link" href="pagerender.fcgi?artid=1356005&amp;pageindex=5">509</a></div></div><div style="clear: both;"></div></div><div class="section-content"><div class="head1A section-title" id="reference-sec">Selected References</div></div><div class="back-matter-section">These references are in PubMed. This may not be the complete list of references from this article.	</div><div class="back-matter-section"><ul class="back-ref-list" style="list-style-type: disc;"><li id="OCR_00490">Baldwin, J; Heer, FW; Albo, R; Peloso, O; Ruby, L; Silen, W. Effect of vagus nerve stimulation on hepatic secretion of bile in human subject. <span><span class="ref-journal">Am J Surg. </span>1966 Jan;<span class="ref-vol">111</span>(1):66–69.</span>  <span style="white-space: nowrap;">[<a class="ref-extlink" href="redirect3.cgi?&amp;&amp;auth=02mkhE4CfWogzVCv_deXXitHEfcXbMeXzBGPnOkdu&amp;reftype=pubmed&amp;artid=1356005&amp;article-id=1356005&amp;iid=126704&amp;issue-id=126704&amp;jid=230&amp;journal-id=230&amp;FROM=Article%7CCitationRef&amp;TO=Entrez%7CPubMed%7CRecord&amp;rendering-type=normal&amp;&amp;http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/5901378">PubMed</a>]</span></li><li id="OCR_00495">Csendes, A; Walsh, JH; Grossman, MI. Effects of atropine and of antral acidification on gastrin release and acid secretion in response to insulin and feeding in dogs. <span><span class="ref-journal">Gastroenterology. </span>1972 Aug;<span class="ref-vol">63</span>(2):257–263.</span>  <span style="white-space: nowrap;">[<a class="ref-extlink" href="redirect3.cgi?&amp;&amp;auth=0NuRIbK7w9gDqPq6TdU-LUNVeKPFi8dZ9jl4hXkvC&amp;reftype=pubmed&amp;artid=1356005&amp;article-id=1356005&amp;iid=126704&amp;issue-id=126704&amp;jid=230&amp;journal-id=230&amp;FROM=Article%7CCitationRef&amp;TO=Entrez%7CPubMed%7CRecord&amp;rendering-type=normal&amp;&amp;http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.